## 5. Information Architecture

```
/                                    → Home (Deck Grid + Search + Filters)
/decks/:id                           → Individual Deck Viewer
/reveals/:id/v{n}.html               → Raw Reveal.js HTML (iframe source, versioned)
content/decks/*.md                   → Deck metadata (Nuxt Content, not a route)
```

### Sitemap

```
Home
├── Search Bar (autocomplete, real-time)
├── Filter Tags (toggleable categories)
├── Deck Grid (responsive card layout)
│   └── Deck Card → links to /decks/:id
└── Sort Controls (date, title, duration)

Deck Viewer (/decks/:id)
├── Breadcrumb: Home > Deck Title
├── Reveal.js iframe (embedded presentation)
├── Navigation Controls (prev/next/fullscreen)
├── Version Selector (dropdown, shown when versions > 1)
└── Metadata Sidebar
